    "findings": [
      "20-6 comparison diagram uses projected OFF/ON platforms with camera, internal-resolution and exposure/light conditions spanning both. Orange arrow grows without suggesting that a promotional comparison isolates one feature or proves universal quality superiority.",
      "21m-1 twelve projected light blocks and a teal receiver are joined by four orange rays advancing during narration. 2024 UE5.5 experimental label and explicit illustrative12-light/4-ray caveat prevent treating them as measured implementation counts or performance.",
      "21m-2 candidate2 is partly occluded by a vertical wall with a visible side face; red ray ends at that wall while green ray reaches candidate3. Candidate importance differs from visibility. Repeated sampled states retain accurate foreground occlusion and no accidental label clipping.",
      "21m-3 independent Forward+ candidate-list and stochastic-selection/reuse/reconstruction platforms show six teal candidate connections versus one orange selected connection with dim background candidates. Labels distinguish pipeline responsibilities and make no same-cost, same-quality or proprietary-internals claim.",
      "Frame956 still20-6/95721m-1,194821m-1/194921m-2,275521m-2/275621m-3; final3645 remains21m-3. All11boards42samples read. Black field, white body and yellow headings; projected top/front/side faces throughout. Clean source has no burned narration captions."
